# Decide Slurp Scheduler on Flagg

Choose how ~5-minute slurp cadence runs on the configured host: launchd plist, Inngest cron, joelclaw wake, or hybrid. Must expose health to `content-grill doctor` and survive reboot.

## Step

Grill Joel with failure-mode scenarios (missed tick, overlapping runs, stale cursor). Resolved when scheduler choice and ops receipt path are recorded.
